# satori's packages until the rename (DEC-008). Conflicts makes apt remove
# satori-installer (and its diversions) before this package is unpacked.
Conflicts: satori-installer
Replaces: satori-installer
Description: Tekne installer (live session only)
 tekne-install copies the Tekne live system to a whole disk, with optional
 LUKS2 encryption, on BIOS or UEFI machines, using a keyboard-driven gum
 interface. It also has an unattended mode for automated tests.
 .
 This package belongs to the live image only; the installer purges it from
 the installed system.
